  dialogueSet:
  - text: Oh wow
    profile: 1
  - text: That's a really nice bowl of ramen!!
    profile: 1
  - text: The spoon turned out so good too
    profile: 1
  - text: This looks so good
    profile: 1
  - text: What a sight for sore eyes
    profile: 0
  - text: (I've been staring at a screen for 16 hours straight)
    profile: 0
  - text: Ah, well
    profile: 0
  - text: That egg makes the effort so worth it
    profile: 0
  - text: You had that in the BAG LET'S GOOOO
    profile: 3
  - text: Or should I say the bowl?
    profile: 3
  - text: We just wrapped up our project too!
    profile: 2
  - text: Let's head to the closing ceremony
    profile: 2
  - text: Hand us the bowl and we'll show you what we've got!
    profile: 2
  - text: We're so proud of you!!!
    profile: 3
  - text: We'll meet you upstairs when you're ready!
    profile: 3
